00:28:10,067 --> 00:28:12,200
但市面上根本就没有任何一辆车能让我由衷感叹：
but there's nothing out there
I would really, really say,

533
00:28:12,233 --> 00:28:14,267
“我真他妈太想买那玩意儿了。”
"I really,
really would like that."

534
00:28:14,300 --> 00:28:15,467
阿斯顿·马丁DB9呢？
Aston Martin DB9.

535
00:28:15,500 --> 00:28:16,867
哎，我确实去看过，
Well, I've looked at that,

536
00:28:16,867 --> 00:28:20,467
但他们给我的提车时间排到了2007年……
but they've given me
a time to get one of 2007...

537
00:28:20,500 --> 00:28:21,933
罗杰，信我准没错。
Roger, trust me on this.

538
00:28:21,967 --> 00:28:23,533
冲着你，
我明天就给你搞一辆来。
For you,
I'll get you one tomorrow.

539
00:28:23,567 --> 00:28:24,700
真的假的？
Really?

540
00:28:24,733 --> 00:28:26,033
看在你带给我那么多快乐的份上，
For all the pleasure
you've given me,

541
00:28:26,067 --> 00:28:28,067
明儿一早我就给阿斯顿·马丁打电话，
I shall ring Aston Martin up
in the morning,

542
00:28:28,100 --> 00:28:31,467
对他们说：“要是罗杰·达尔特雷提不到车，
老子就过去把你们的厂子给烧了……”
and say, "I'll come round and
burn your factory down if
Roger Daltrey doesn't..."

543
00:28:31,500 --> 00:28:34,500
因为你以前就开过阿斯顿·马丁，对吧？一辆DB4。
'Cause you had an Aston
before, didn't you? A DB4.

544
00:28:34,533 --> 00:28:40,600
没错，1966年那会儿
我有过一辆非常漂亮的DB4。
Yeah, I had
a lovely DB4 in 1966.

545
00:28:40,633 --> 00:28:43,467
一辆极其惊艳的奶油白DB4。
A really wonderful cream DB4.

546
00:28:43,500 --> 00:28:47,000
我巡演的时候犯了个大错，
把车借给了我的几个哥们儿。
I made the mistake
of lending it to my mates
when I went on tour.

547
00:28:47,033 --> 00:28:48,533
当时我们去美国搞了三个月的巡演，
We were on a three month tour
of America

548
00:28:48,567 --> 00:28:51,633
临走前我还叮嘱：
“帮我把车照顾好。”
and I said,
"Look after the car for me."

549
00:28:51,667 --> 00:28:54,167
呵，他们可真是“照顾”得妥妥当当！
Yeah, they looked after it
all right!

550
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:57,433
巡演结束回来，我重新坐进这辆车，
And I came back off tour
and I get back in this car

551
00:28:57,467 --> 00:29:00,700
一路开着它从机场回家，
and I'm driving it
from the airport home

552
00:29:00,733 --> 00:29:02,867
心里直纳闷：
“这感觉不太对劲啊。”
and I thought,
"This doesn't feel right."

553
00:29:02,867 --> 00:29:04,467
然后我下车瞧了瞧，
And I get out a bit

554
00:29:04,500 --> 00:29:07,867
它当时正好停在
一辆破烂不堪的小1100旁边。
and it was, kind of,
drawn up alongside
a nasty little 1100.

555
00:29:07,867 --> 00:29:10,200
-你还记得当年那款烂车吧？
-记得。
-Do you remember
that awful car those days?
-Yeah.

556
00:29:10,233 --> 00:29:14,333
我当时就琢磨：“按理说
它应该比奥斯汀1100长一截才对啊。”
And I thought, "It's supposed
to be a bit longer
than an Austin 1100."

557
00:29:16,367 --> 00:29:21,100
结果真实情况是，
他们开着我这辆车满城四处招摇，
And what had happened was
they'd been gallivanting
around town in this car

558
00:29:21,133 --> 00:29:24,600
在国王路上尾随了
一整大巴车的漂亮姑娘。
and they'd followed
a coach load of crumpet
down the King's Road.

559
00:29:24,633 --> 00:29:28,633
他们还在车里扯着嗓子喊：“快看我们的车！”
又是挥手又是显摆的，
And they were all saying,
"Look at our car!"
and waving and all this

560
00:29:28,667 --> 00:29:31,300
结果前面的大巴突然停了。
and the coach stopped.

561
00:29:31,333 --> 00:29:34,233
我的阿斯顿整辆车直接怼进了
一辆大巴车的屁股，
And my Aston went completely
up the rear of this coach

562
00:29:34,267 --> 00:29:37,000
他们根本掏不起钱好好修。
and they couldn't afford
to repair it properly.

563
00:29:37,033 --> 00:29:40,567
于是他们干出了典型的
牧羊丛和奇斯威克老哥
才干得出来的野路子。
So, they did what only
any Shepherds Bush,
Chiswick guy could do.

564
00:29:40,600 --> 00:29:44,333
他们直接把撞瘪的那截给锯了，
都没换整个前脸。
They chopped the bit
that was bent off,
not the whole front.

565
00:29:45,267 --> 00:29:47,300
就单单切了撞弯的那一小块。
Just the bit that was bent.

566
00:29:47,333 --> 00:29:51,267
然后他们居然不知从哪
搞来了四分之一个车头……
And they somehow
managed to buy a quarter
of a front end...

567
00:29:52,367 --> 00:29:53,867
硬生生焊了上去。
And welded it on.

568
00:29:53,900 --> 00:29:57,067
再把我车上也切掉一块，
勉勉强强能凑合拼上。
And chopped enough off my car
so that it would kind of fit.

569
00:29:57,100 --> 00:29:59,867
刚好让轮子转起来
不至于蹭到车壳。
So the wheel just about turned
without missing it.

570
00:29:59,867 --> 00:30:01,300
咱们说的就是台下那位，对吧？
It's him that
we're talking about, isn't it?

571
00:30:01,333 --> 00:30:02,633
-就是诺比，没错。
-这位就是诺比。
-It's Nobby, yeah.
-This is Nobby.

572
00:30:02,667 --> 00:30:03,867
就是他。他今天居然……
It's him. He's actually...

573
00:30:03,900 --> 00:30:05,600
克拉克森：我们今晚把他给请来了。
CLARKSON: We've brought
him along tonight.

574
00:30:05,633 --> 00:30:07,700
这家伙撞烂了你的阿斯顿，
你居然还跟他称兄道弟？
The man who crashed
your Aston and you're
still mates with him?

575
00:30:07,733 --> 00:30:09,200
现在是他不肯让我开他的车了。
He won't let me drive
his car now.

576
00:30:11,033 --> 00:30:13,767
我一点都不意外。
好了听着，说到车，
I'm not surprised.
Now listen, talking of cars,

577
00:30:13,867 --> 00:30:17,467
重点是，我们知道你震撼过谢伊体育场，
当过电影明星，
thing is, we know you've
wowed the Shea Stadium,
you've been a movie star,

578
00:30:17,500 --> 00:30:20,700
但这显然才是你职业生涯的巅峰。
but obviously this is the
pinnacle of your career.

579
00:30:20,733 --> 00:30:22,367
你来到了这里，
坐进了这辆利亚纳（Liana）。
You're here.
You're in the Liana.

580
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:25,033
那么，有谁想看罗杰的圈速？
So, who'd like to see
Roger's lap?

581
00:30:25,067 --> 00:30:27,400
-观众：想！
-咱们一起来瞧瞧。
-AUDIENCE: Yes!
-Let's have a look.

582
00:30:28,933 --> 00:30:30,600
克拉克森：起步很棒，
气势很足。
CLARKSON: Good,
aggressive start.

583
00:30:30,633 --> 00:30:31,867
（叹气）
(SIGHING)

584
00:30:34,067 --> 00:30:36,400
到了，第一个弯，
这个弯非常棘手。
Here we are, first corner,
very tricky one, this.

585
00:30:37,233 --> 00:30:38,633
（哔——）
(BLEEP)

586
00:30:38,667 --> 00:30:40,733
（达尔特里大笑）
(DALTREY LAUGHING)

587
00:30:40,767 --> 00:30:42,633
其实赛道看着不算湿，
Actually, the track doesn't
look wet,

588
00:30:42,667 --> 00:30:46,100
但斯提格跟我说，
路面简直滑得邪门。
but The Stig tells me it's
unbelievably greasy out there.

589
00:30:47,000 --> 00:30:49,100
达尔特里：确实很滑。
DALTREY: Very.

590
00:30:49,133 --> 00:30:51,133
克拉克森：
现在过来了，通过锤头弯……
CLARKSON:
Now over here, through
the Hammerhead...

591
00:30:51,167 --> 00:30:52,333
（轮胎尖叫声）
(TYRES SCREECHING)

592
00:30:52,367 --> 00:30:54,333
噢，太滑了！瞧瞧那架势。
Oh, very greasy! Look at that.

593
00:30:54,367 --> 00:30:56,500
轮胎都没怎么叫而且推头推得厉害，
一眼就能看出来。
There's not much tyre squeal
and it's running wide,
you can tell that.

594
00:30:56,533 --> 00:30:57,567
行吧，那这圈算你“微……”
Yeah, we'll give you
a mildly...

595
00:30:57,600 --> 00:30:59,067
太烂了！
Terrible!

596
00:30:59,100 --> 00:31:00,367
克拉克森：
算你个“微湿路面”成绩。
CLARKSON:
We'll give you
a mildly wet lap.

597
00:31:00,400 --> 00:31:02,100
呃，过连续弯了……
Uh, Follow Through...

598
00:31:02,133 --> 00:31:04,867
看着像是全油门踩到底。
开得漂亮，够有种。
That looked flat out.
That's good and brave.

599
00:31:06,367 --> 00:31:08,567
真挺有种的。
That's good and brave.

600
00:31:08,600 --> 00:31:10,167
倒数第二个弯，没事吧？
Second to last corner,
all right?

601
00:31:10,200 --> 00:31:12,700
来了，就是这个弯，
谁来都得栽跟头。
Here it is, this is the one
that catches everybody out.

602
00:31:12,733 --> 00:31:14,200
你跑得如何？
咱来瞧瞧回放。
How are you doing?
Let's have a look.

603
00:31:14,233 --> 00:31:15,233
嘿！
Hey!

604
00:31:17,933 --> 00:31:19,767
-克拉克森：没错，一如既往……
-达尔特里：我的老天！
-CLARKSON: Yes, as usual...
-DALTREY: Dear God!

605
00:31:19,867 --> 00:31:23,067
克拉克森：最后一个弯，
你切得可真大胆、
真够狠的。
CLARKSON: And last corner,
you're cutting it
good and brave.

606
00:31:23,100 --> 00:31:24,967
杀过甘邦弯，
冲过终点线！
Through Gambon
and across the line!

607
00:31:25,667 --> 00:31:27,267
(观众欢呼)
(AUDIENCE CHEERS)

608
00:31:28,933 --> 00:31:30,133
好的。
Okay.

609
00:31:36,233 --> 00:31:37,500
那你猜你排第几？
Where do you reckon, then?

610
00:31:37,533 --> 00:31:39,600
我其实无所谓，
只要跑赢怀特利就行。
I don't really care
as long as I beat Whitely.

611
00:31:39,633 --> 00:31:40,900
克拉克森：怀特利？
CLARKSON: Whitely?

612
00:31:40,933 --> 00:31:42,200
对，就这要求！
Yeah, that's all!

613
00:31:42,233 --> 00:31:43,867
-这你大可放心。
-我才不在乎！
-Don't worry about that.
-I don't care!

614
00:31:43,867 --> 00:31:47,100
你轻轻松松碾压了
理查德·怀特利。
You've easily beaten
Richard Whitely.

615
00:31:47,133 --> 00:31:49,767
罗杰·达尔特里，你的成绩是
1分……
Roger Daltrey, you did it in
one minute...

616
00:31:49,867 --> 00:31:52,733
-49秒7！
-哇哦！
-49.7 seconds!
-Whoa!

617
00:31:53,233 --> 00:31:54,700
这意味着……
And that is...

618
00:31:55,133 --> 00:31:56,133
(欢呼声)
(CHEERING)

619
00:31:58,400 --> 00:31:59,400
嘿！
Hey!

620
00:32:01,933 --> 00:32:03,400
-比我还快！
-那还不错。
-Faster than me!
-That's all right.

621
00:32:05,133 --> 00:32:07,200
我不得不说，
这成绩真了不起。
That is quite something,
I have to say.

622
00:32:07,233 --> 00:32:10,867
而且今天赛道状况更糟，
因为不仅是湿地。
And it was worse today
because it wasn't just wet.

623
00:32:10,900 --> 00:32:13,033
-有的地方干，
有的地方又滑又腻。
-确实滑得很。
-It was dry bits
and greasy bits.
-It was greasy.

624
00:32:13,067 --> 00:32:15,967
-非常滑。成绩板上可以
给你标个“微湿”。
-噢，挺好。
-It was very greasy. You can
have a "mildly moist" on that.
-Oh, good.

625
00:32:16,867 --> 00:32:20,500
“微湿”。这么说来，
这可是有史以来最快的
Mildly moist. Well,
that's the fastest ever

626
00:32:20,533 --> 00:32:22,033
“微湿”圈速。
mildly moist lap.

627
00:32:22,700 --> 00:32:24,333
我喜欢“微湿”这个词。
I like the mildly moist.

628
00:32:24,367 --> 00:32:26,700
而且如果我没记错的话……
And I think I'm right
in saying...

629
00:32:26,733 --> 00:32:28,533
你现在已经正式
算领养老金的退休人士了吧？
You are officially
a pensioner now, aren't you?

630
00:32:28,567 --> 00:32:30,000
不是。
No.

631
00:32:30,033 --> 00:32:31,567
-明明就是。
-得了吧，
我确实办了老年公交卡。
-Yes.
-Oh, give me a break.
I've got a bus pass.

632
00:32:31,600 --> 00:32:33,067
你办了公交……
You've got a bus...

633
00:32:33,100 --> 00:32:36,200
你可是这里跑得最快的
老年公交卡持有者！
You're the fastest person
with a bus pass here!

634
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:38,467
(掌声)
(APPLAUSE)

635
00:32:38,500 --> 00:32:39,933
-这成绩真的太牛了。
-多谢。
-That is really good.
-Thank you.

636
00:32:45,833 --> 00:32:49,200
你今天能大驾光临，
真是让我开心坏了，
Well, you've made me
a very happy man
coming down here today,

637
00:32:49,233 --> 00:32:52,233
因为我是你的超级粉丝，
彻头彻尾的铁粉。
'cause I am a huge fan
of yours, massively big fan.

638
00:32:52,267 --> 00:32:54,233
今晚我开车回家路上
要一路狂放《Who's Next》，
And I'm going to
play Who's Next
all the way home tonight,

639
00:32:54,267 --> 00:32:56,667
争取15分钟狂飙到家！
and make it home
in 15 minutes!

640
00:32:56,700 --> 00:32:57,767
总之，非常感谢你的到来。
So, thanks very much
for coming.

641
00:32:57,800 --> 00:33:00,033
女士们先生们，
罗杰·达尔特里！
Ladies and gentlemen,
Roger Daltrey!

642
00:33:00,067 --> 00:33:01,067
谢谢大家。
Thank you.

643
00:33:02,800 --> 00:33:05,400
克拉克森：我很享受。
真的很过瘾。
CLARKSON: I enjoyed it.
I really enjoyed it.

644
00:33:09,000 --> 00:33:14,800
好，来看看新款Boxster。
跟老款Boxster长得一模一样。
Right, meet the new Boxster.
Same as the old Boxster.

645
00:33:14,833 --> 00:33:19,833
说实话，我真看不出他们改了哪儿，
但保时捷确实动了微调。
To be honest, I really can't tell what
they've done, but Porsche have tweaked it.

646
00:33:19,867 --> 00:33:24,867
他们让它更快、更好开了，
而且绝对棒极了。
They've made it faster, better to drive,
and it is absolutely terrific.

647
00:33:24,900 --> 00:33:29,700
所以它依然是最棒的敞篷跑车。
- 是吗？你看，并不是。
So it is still the best roadster.
- It is, yes? See, it's not.

648
00:33:29,733 --> 00:33:35,933
根本不是，因为这台才是。全新SLK。
敞篷跑车之王。快瞧瞧它！
It just isn't because this is. The new SLK.
The king of the roadsters. Just look at it!

649
00:33:35,967 --> 00:33:39,167
不管是里是外都美极了，
而且还聪明得很。
It is gorgeous outside and in,
and it's clever too.

650
00:33:39,200 --> 00:33:46,100
这个“头颈暖风系统”内置在头枕里，
能绕着你的脖子吹出暖风，
This "air scarf" is built into the headrest
and blows warm air round your neck,

651
00:33:46,133 --> 00:33:48,333
就像条围巾一样，让你在敞篷开着的时候
也能暖暖和和的。
like a scarf, to keep you cosy when
you've got the roof down.

652
00:33:49,600 --> 00:33:52,300
你还能拿它当吹风机用呢！
- 很好笑吗？呵。哈！哈哈哈哈！
And you could use it as a hair dryer!
- Funny. Yes. Haha! Hahahaha!

653
00:33:52,333 --> 00:33:59,333
我能聊聊数据吗？
我的车：280匹马力，比你的多8匹。
Can I just talk about figures for a moment?
My car: 280bhp, 8 more than yours.

654
00:33:59,367 --> 00:34:02,667
0到60英里加速大概5秒，
比你快了半秒，
0-60 in about 5 seconds,
half a second quicker than yours,

655
00:34:02,700 --> 00:34:09,533
极速168英里对155英里……
- 毫无意义！那只是被电子限速在155
168mph, 155mph...
- It's useless! Artificially limited to 155

656
00:34:09,567 --> 00:34:12,167
英里每小时，再说了，
冷冰冰的数据又说明不了一切。
miles an hour, and anyway, figures
don't tell you the whole story.

657
00:34:12,200 --> 00:34:17,500
正因如此，今天早些时候，
我们把这两辆车都交给了斯提格。
Which is why earlier on today, we gave
both of these cars to The Stig.

658
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:28,000
行吧，那就……
- 那你报啊。
Ok, so.
- Go on then.

659
00:35:28,033 --> 00:35:30,033
不，你先报。
- 门儿都没有，先生。
No, you say it first.
- No sir.

660
00:35:30,067 --> 00:35:33,000
好吧，1分32秒9……
Okay, 1:32.9...

661
00:35:33,033 --> 00:35:35,033
[梅大笑]
[MAY LAUGHS]

662
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:40,500
快告诉我成绩！
- 1分28秒7！
Just tell me the time!
- 1:28.7!

663
00:35:40,533 --> 00:35:42,533
太爽啦！
[掌声]
Yeeeessss!
[APPLAUSE]

664
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:50,833
这不过是个数字！这台车的魅力
绝不仅限于这种冷冰冰的数据！
It's just a number! This is a car with more
to it than just figures like that!

665
00:35:50,867 --> 00:35:55,467
它漂亮极了！除了你瞎了眼，
没人会否认这辆车颜值更高！
It is beautiful! Nobody but you could
deny that this is the better looking car!

666
00:35:55,500 --> 00:36:00,367
而且，容我提醒一句，
它比那台便宜了整整4000英镑。
